      "mixed source systems"
    ]
  },
  "analysis_expectations": [
    "Normalize identifiers before grouping or duplicate detection.",
    "Build rolling demand statistics from chronology rather than accepting precomputed features.",
    "Construct future-demand targets only from later realized weeks.",
    "Derive supplier order_qty_ratio and urgency from raw quantities/dates.",
    "Construct delay labels from realized delivery outcomes without using those outcomes as inputs.",
    "Investigate missing values, duplicates and extreme observations with surrounding business evidence.",
    "Document every cleaning/label choice and validate its effect."
  ],
